To adjust the session capacity for up to 500 dynamic BGP peers on your Nokia 7750 SR router, apply the following configuration:

```
configure router bgp
    dynamic-neighbor-limit 500
    exit
```

This command sets the instance-wide limit to accept 500 dynamic BGP sessions. Ensure your existing peer groups have proper `dynamic-neighbor` configurations (e.g., `prefix` ranges) to match incoming peers. The change takes effect immediately for new sessions without disrupting established peers.
