"During our maintenance window next week, we need to adjust the TCP session persistence settings on our Huawei NE40E core routers to better align with long-lived application flows—specifically, I'd like to ensure the initial keepalive probe delay is extended to five minutes to prevent unnecessary connection teardowns during sustained data transfers between regional data centers."
