To globally deactivate the BGP add-paths feature and prevent the advertisement of multiple paths for all address families, use the following CLI configuration command:

```cli
configure router bgp
    no add-paths
exit
```

This command removes all add-paths support at the global BGP instance level, ensuring no address family advertises multiple paths. Existing BGP sessions will reset to apply the change.
