"During a recent core network upgrade, we need to ensure certain edge routers receive our default route while maintaining stricter routing policies for other peers—what's the recommended approach to selectively originate and advertise a default BGP route to designated neighbors on Nokia 7750 SR (Alcatel-Lucent) SR OS platforms without impacting the full routing table distribution?"
