     - `15`: 15-minute delay after a subsequent failure.  
     - `60`: Maximum 60-minute delay.  
   - **`error-interval 15`**: Requires 15 minutes of stable operation to reset the failure penalty.  

This combination allows sessions to withstand short flaps while suppressing excessive re-establishment attempts during persistent instability. Adjust the `idle-hold-time` and `error-interval` values based on observed failure patterns.
