## User question:
"During a BGP route optimization project, we need to ensure our Nokia 7750 SR routers consistently enforce a local LLGR stale time setting of one hour, even when peers advertise conflicting values—what’s the recommended approach to implement this override while maintaining stability in the routing domain?"
