## Router configuration manual:
CLIs:
export <plcy-or-long-expr> [ <plcy-or-expr> [ <plcy-or-expr> ] ]
no export [ <plcy-or-long-expr> ]
FuncDef:
This command specifies route policies that control the handling of outbound routes transmitted to certain peers. Route policies are configured in theconfig>router>policy-optionscontext.
