To configure next-hop resolution for labeled unicast routes on Nokia 7750 SR routers, use the following CLI hierarchy and commands:

```cli
configure router
    bgp
        next-hop-resolution
            labeled-routes
                transport-tunnel
                    family label-ipv4
                        resolution-filter
                            sr-policy
                    exit
                    family label-ipv6
                        resolution-filter
                            sr-policy
```

This structure configures both IPv4 and IPv6 labeled unicast routes under the `transport-tunnel` context. The `sr-policy` command enables Segment Routing policies for next-hop resolution. Replace `sr-policy` with other tunnel types (e.g., `ldp`, `rsvp`) if needed.
