ParaDef:
{'Parameters': 'number', 'Info': 'Specifies the MED path attribute value, expressed as a decimal integer. Values-0 to 4294967295.'}
{'Parameters': 'igp-cost', 'Info': 'Sets MED to the IGP cost of the given IP prefix.'}
