## Proposed answer:
To address persistent IP fragmentation issues during high-throughput transfers on your Nokia 7750 SR, enable TCP path MTU discovery for BGP sessions to allow dynamic MTU adjustment via ICMP feedback:

```
configure router bgp
    path-mtu-discovery
```

This configuration ensures:
- Initial TCP MTU is set to the egress interface MTU
- DF (Don't Fragment) bit is enabled in packets
- Routers along the path trigger ICMP feedback for MTU adjustments
- Sessions dynamically adapt to path MTU changes without fragmentation penalties
