"During a recent network upgrade, we're implementing BGP optimal route reflection on our Huawei NE40E routers and need to assign a secondary IPv6 address (2001:db8::2) to a specific location for redundancy. What's the proper method to integrate this backup address into the route reflector configuration without disrupting existing peer sessions?"

