## Proposed answer:
To implement label security for VPNv6 services while maintaining compatibility with existing IPv4 VPNs on your Nokia 7750 SR PE routers, use the following configuration:

```cli
/configure router bgp
    neighbor-trust vpn-ipv4 vpn-ipv6
```

**Explanation:**  
This command enables inter-AS label validation for both VPN IPv4 (`vpn-ipv4`) and VPN IPv6 (`vpn-ipv6`) address families simultaneously. By explicitly including both parameters:
