---
## Proposed answer:
To ensure routers discard routes with an "Invalid" RPKI origin validation state during BGP best-path selection, configure the following:

```
configure router bgp
    best-path-selection
        origin-invalid-unusable
```

This command marks routes with an "Invalid" RPKI state as unusable, excluding them from best-path calculations and advertisements without altering existing policies.
