To ensure immediate propagation of BGP route withdrawals and minimize blackhole periods during link decommissions, enable the `rapid-withdrawal` feature. This disables the default delay in sending BGP withdrawals, accelerating convergence in your MPLS backbone:

```cli
configure router bgp
