## User question:
"During a recent multicast VPN deployment using IPv6, we noticed that BGP updates for the MVPN-IPv6 AFI are propagating slower than expected between our Nokia 7750 SR PE routers. Could you advise how to optimize the convergence time by enabling faster route refresh capabilities specifically for this address family?"
---
## Proposed answer:
To optimize BGP convergence for MVPN-IPv6 updates on Nokia 7750 SR routers, enable rapid update for the MVPN-IPv6 address family with the following command:

```cli
configure router bgp
    rapid-update mvpn-ipv6
```

This configuration accelerates MVPN-IPv6 route propagation by prioritizing updates for this address family.
---
## Router configuration manual:
CLIs:
rapid-update [ l2-vpn ] [ mvpn-ipv4 ] [ mvpn-ipv6 ] [ mdt-safi ] [ evpn ] [ label-ipv4 ] [ label-ipv6 ] [ vpn-ipv4 ] [ vpn-ipv6 ] [ mcast-vpn-ipv4 ] [ mcast-vpn-ipv6 ]
no rapid-update
FuncDef:
This command enables and disables BGP rapid update for specified address families.
ParaDef:
{'Parameters': 'l2-vpn', 'Info': 'Specifies the BGP rapid update for the 12-byte Virtual Switch Instance identifier (VSI-ID) value consisting of the 8-byte route distinguisher (RD) followed by a 4-byte value.'}
{'Parameters': 'mvpn-ipv4', 'Info': 'Specifies BGP rapid update for the mvpn-ipv4 address family. The mvpn-pv4 address is a variable size value consisting of the 1-byte route type, 1-byte length and variable size that is route type specific. Route type defines encoding for the route type specific field. Length indicates the length in octets of the route type specific field.'}
{'Parameters': 'mdt-safi', 'Info': 'Specifies BGP rapid update for the mdt-safi address family. The address is a 16-byte value consisting of 12-byte route distinguisher (RD) followed by a 4-byte group address.'}
{'Parameters': 'mvpn-ipv6', 'Info': 'Specifies BGP rapid update for the mvpn-ipv6 address family.'}
{'Parameters': 'evpn', 'Info': 'Specifies BGP rapid update for the evpn address family by including or removing EVPN routes from the set of routes that can trigger rapid update.'}
