This command enables a label security feature for prefixes of a VPN family at an inter-AS boundary.
ParaDef:
{'Parameters': 'vpn-ipv4', 'Info': 'Enables the inter-AS label security for VPN IPv4 family.'}
{'Parameters': 'vpn-ipv6', 'Info': 'Enables the inter-AS label security for VPN IPv6 family.'}
