{'Parameters': 'initial-wait initial-wait', 'Info': 'Specifies the initial SPF calculation delay in seconds after a topology change. Values-1 to 300. ParamDefault: Default- 5'}
{'Parameters': 'second-wait second-wait', 'Info': 'Specifies the delay in seconds between the first and second SPF calculation and the exponential delay increment. Values-1 to 300. ParamDefault: Default- 15'}
