```console
configure
    bmp
        station REMOTE-MONITORING-1
            connection
                tcp-keepalive
                    keep-idle 300
                    keep-interval 30
                    keep-count 5
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

**Key parameters configured:**  
- `keep-idle 300`: First TCP keepalive probe after 300 seconds (5 minutes) of idle time  
- `keep-interval 30`: 30 seconds between subsequent keepalive probes  
- `keep-count 5`: Connection declared down after 5 consecutive missed probes  

**Notes:**  
1. Replace `REMOTE-MONITORING-1` with your actual station name  
2. Total failure detection time: 300s (idle) + (5 probes × 30s) = 450s (7.5 minutes)  
3. Balances stability (generous timeout) with control plane efficiency (reduced probe frequency vs default 15s)
