To implement route validation for prefix-containing flowspec NLRI on your Nokia 7750 SR, enable destination prefix validation under BGP flowspec with these commands:

```
configure router
    bgp
        flowspec
            validate-dest-prefix
```

This configuration ensures BGP verifies flowspec rules containing destination prefixes before installation in the forwarding plane. The validation:
- Checks IPv4/IPv6 flowspec routes with destination-prefix subcomponents
- Prevents malformed or harmful traffic steering directives
- Applies to all received flowspec NLRI with destination-based filtering criteria

The default state (`no validate-dest-prefix`) does not perform this validation, so explicit enablement is required.
------------
