To establish connectivity between your BMP monitoring station and the VPRN instance "customer-backbone," configure the following commands on your Nokia 7750 SR router:

```console
configure service vprn "customer-backbone"
    bgp
        monitor
            station "bmp-station-1"
                route-monitoring pre-policy post-policy
                connection
                    router "customer-backbone"
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
exit
```

**Key Configuration Notes:**  
1. Replace `"bmp-station-1"` with your actual BMP monitoring station name  
2. The `route-monitoring` command enables both pre-policy and post-policy route updates to provide comprehensive visibility  
3. The `router "customer-backbone"` directive binds the BMP connection to your VPRN instance  
4. All existing routing policies in the VPRN are preserved as this configuration operates within the service context  

Verify connectivity after applying the configuration. For additional stations, replicate the `station` block with appropriate names.
