To ensure previously learned BGP routes remain in the routing table for up to 5 minutes during neighbor reestablishment, configure the following commands on your Nokia 7750 SR router:

```cli
configure router bgp
    graceful-restart
        restart-time 300
        stale-routes-time 300
        enable-notification
    exit
exit
```

**Explanation:**  
- `graceful-restart` enables BGP helper functionality to retain routes during neighbor restarts.  
- `restart-time 300` sets the advertised restart duration to 5 minutes (300 seconds).  
- `stale-routes-time 300` maintains learned routes in the routing table for 5 minutes while reestablishing sessions.  
- `enable-notification` allows graceful handling during NOTIFICATION events to prevent route flapping.  

This configuration preserves forwarding continuity and minimizes route flapping during maintenance.
