To ensure stale routes persist for the full 300-second recovery period during BGP graceful restart implementation on your Nokia 7750 SR routers, configure the following:

```cli
configure router bgp
    graceful-restart
        restart-time 300
        stale-routes-time 300
    exit
```

### Explanation:
1. **`graceful-restart`**: Enables BGP graceful restart helper functionality to preserve routes during neighbor restarts.
2. **`restart-time 300`**: Advertises a 300-second recovery period to peers, matching the desired maintenance window.
3. **`stale-routes-time 300`**: Ensures stale routes are retained for exactly 300 seconds, preventing premature flushing and route flapping.

This configuration guarantees that routes remain stable throughout the maintenance window without unnecessary churn. Apply these commands globally in the BGP context to cover all peers.
------------
