## User question:
"During a recent core network upgrade, we're implementing BGP-labeled routes on our Nokia 7750 SR routers but need to ensure route resolution is strictly limited to specific tunnel types defined in the resolution filter—how would you approach this selective binding configuration to maintain deterministic path selection without impacting other MPLS services?"
